            <field name="description">Official minimum daily wage in LBP of a daily or hourly worker, set with the monthly amount by the same decrees: LBP 410,000, 820,000 and 1,300,000 from 1 August 2025. Compared with the hourly wage of a day of the working schedule by a payroll warning.</field>
