            <field name="code">l10n_lb_nssf_eos_age</field>
            <field name="description">The employer stops paying the end-of-service contribution when the employee reaches 64 complete, the indemnity being liquidated (Social Security Code, art. 50 and 73 §1; Labour Code, art. 55).</field>
